			"name": "Guns",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The radium carbine, a Vanguard's standard-issue weapon (framework.md's Mechanicus weapon anchor table); short-ranged compared to a Ranger's galvanic rifle but devastating against unsealed targets.\n\nDesign: DX+5 (18) for 20 points, Easy (B170).",
